       fhir:v "An individual who helps to record, organize, store, compute and retrieve information, including patient records and registers. The knowledge and skills required are usually obtained through on- the-job training but may include post-secondary education. Clerks may also transcribe data, tally data, fill in routine reports and review the quality of data with others."
